# Copy to .env next to this file, then fill in a real key:
#
#   openssl rand -base64 32
#
# This key encrypts every project key, and through them every artifact,
# handoff, secret and history object (docs/adr/0005). Losing it means losing
# the data; leaking it means losing the confidentiality of all of it. Back it
# up somewhere other than this directory.
CC_ROOT_KEY=
